<view class="shell"><view class="heading">家长账号与孩子档案</view><view class="notice error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{notice}}">{{notice}}</view><view wx:if="{{!user}}" class="panel"><view class="subheading">先体验，也可以登录</view><view class="muted">访客可使用全部学习内容。登录并选择孩子后，导学进度与网站共用。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="wechatLogin" disabled="{{busy || !wechatReady}}">微信登录</button><view class="muted" wx:if="{{!wechatReady}}">微信登录尚未开通。可先学习，或使用已有的家长用户名。</view><view class="form-label">已有的家长用户名</view><input class="input" value="{{username}}" data-key="username" bindinput="input" maxlength="64" placeholder="家长用户名"/><view class="form-label">密码</view><input class="input" value="{{password}}" data-key="password" bindinput="input" password="true" maxlength="128" placeholder="家长密码"/><button bindtap="usernameLogin" disabled="{{busy}}">用户名登录</button><button bindtap="guest" disabled="{{busy}}">继续访客学习</button><view class="muted">需要注册用户名账号时，可在 games.nblord.com/account.html 创建。</view></view><view wx:if="{{user}}"><view class="panel"><view class="subheading">{{user.displayUsername || user.username || user.name || '微信家长'}}</view><view class="muted">每个孩子都有独立的导学进度与本页练习记录。</view><view wx:for="{{profiles}}" wx:key="id" class="profile"><view class="block-title">{{item.nickname}}</view><view class="muted">{{selected.id === item.id ? '当前学习档案' : '独立保存英语进度'}}</view><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectProfile" disabled="{{busy}}">{{selected.id === item.id ? '重新检查同步' : '选择这个孩子'}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{profiles.length < 8}}"><view class="form-label">孩子昵称（1至20个字）</view><input class="input" value="{{nickname}}" data-key="nickname" bindinput="input" maxlength="20" placeholder="例如：小豆"/><view class="form-label">档案头像</view><picker range="{{avatars}}" value="{{avatarIndex}}" bindchange="avatar"><view class="picker">{{avatars[avatarIndex]}}</view></picker><button class="primary" bindtap="createProfile" disabled="{{busy}}">创建孩子档案</button></view><button class="primary" bindtap="learn" disabled="{{busy || !selected}}">接着学习</button></view><view class="panel" wx:if="{{selected}}"><view class="subheading">当前孩子的导学进度</view><view wx:if="{{conflict}}" class="notice">另一台设备也更新了进度。答题记录会合并，请选择要接着学的课堂位置。</view><view wx:if="{{conflict}}" class="row"><button data-choice="local" bindtap="resolve" disabled="{{busy}}">接着此设备课堂</button><button data-choice="cloud" bindtap="resolve" disabled="{{busy}}">接着云端课堂</button></view><button wx:if="{{pending && !conflict}}" bindtap="sync" disabled="{{busy}}">同步待上传记录</button><view class="muted">访客导学进度可导入空白的孩子档案；已有进度的档案不会覆盖。</view><button bindtap="importGuest" disabled="{{busy}}">导入此设备访客导学进度</button></view><view class="panel"><button wx:if="{{wechatReady && !user.wechatAccount}}" bindtap="linkWechat" disabled="{{busy}}">关联微信到当前家长账号</button><view wx:if="{{wechatReady && !user.wechatAccount}}" class="muted">请在刚完成登录后关联；一个微信身份仅能关联一个家庭。</view><button bindtap="guest" disabled="{{busy}}">暂用访客档案</button><button bindtap="logout" disabled="{{busy}}">退出登录</button></view></view></view>
